const bullets = [
  'Why sending more applications is the slowest way to get a remote job, and the apply-then-outreach sequence that gets you noticed by a real person.',
  'The Surround Strategy: how to reach the peer, the manager and the boss at one company so your name keeps coming up in their week.',
  'Why a LinkedIn connection request with no note gets accepted far more often (most people do the opposite).',
  'The subject-line trick, built around a single slash, that gets cold emails opened by busy hiring managers.',
  'How to call a US hiring manager from Nigeria using a US number, so where you live is not the first thing they judge.',
  'What to say when the gatekeeper asks "what\'s this regarding?", and the line that gets you put through.',
  'The one answer that turns "you\'re in Nigeria?" from a deal-breaker into a reason to hire you.',
  'How to run a discovery call like a doctor, so the interviewer ends up selling the job to you.',
  'SPIN, MEDDIC and tactical empathy, explained so simply you\'ll use them in your next conversation.',
  'The 7 interview questions every SDR candidate gets, and how to answer each one in your own voice.',
  'Why your energy on a call matters more than your accent, and how to manage it across 50 dials.',
