  ['Write LinkedIn messages and cold emails that get replies (Modules 2, 3)', 'Outbound messaging that books meetings'],
  ['Run cold calls, out loud, with objections (Modules 4, 5)', 'Cold calling, the skill most SDRs avoid'],
